    "text": "49 minutes ago ANOKA, Minn. — It's not often that you see the word \"boondoggle,\" but Anoka County alleges that's exactly what's happening in the City of Anoka. The county is suing the Minnesota Department of Transportation (MnDOT), alleging that DFL State Representative Zack Stephenson misused the legislative process for \"his own pet project at the expense of Anoka County taxpayers.\" Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
